WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Okay, senior

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,780
There are two shovelbirds

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,780
Wait a minute. I'll share some with you soon.

4
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:12,190
Delicious. Finally tastes good.

5
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,690
Eat quickly and take a good rest after eating.

6
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:17,190
Tomorrow is the last day. I hope the box is located closer.

7
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:20,190
Senior, if tomorrow the box is still far away

8
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:21,190
Let's just cut down the trees.

9
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:23,190
Yeah, okay. The wooden house is too crude at the moment.

10
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:25,190
It will leak if it rains

11
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:26,190
It is indeed possible to upgrade

12
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:28,190
I don’t know what talents other people have drawn.

13
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,190
In case we meet in the future

14
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:31,190
We might have to fight over resources.

15
00:00:31,190 --> 00:00:33,570
Now I can get more information and try it out

16
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:36,570
I gained the sword specialization talent

17
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:38,570
As long as it's a sword, I can master it completely

18
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:40,570
I gained the talent of strange strength

19
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,570
I can lift five hundred pounds

20
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:45,400
This lady has obtained the talent of farming

21
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:48,400
No edible plant can escape my eyes.
